cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata.
title: "BDPU-LatentClass: Latent-Class Probabilities and Uncertainty from Paired Quantitative Assays"
abstract: "BDPU-LatentClass estimates latent-class probabilities from paired quantitative assays in the absence of a gold standard. It uses a two-class Gaussian mixture with class-specific covariance and identifies the target class by its higher mean log concentration on the first assay. The Wolfram notebook reports both class probabilities, credible intervals, and parameter, analytical measurement, and total standard uncertainties."
